add("NewParents-1wvytj6", None, "new_mother", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "pain", ["contact_naps", "maternal_exhaustion"], "I'm also realizing what it means to be \"touched out\" which I didn't think was going to be a problem for me, as I've never had constant contact before. I just want some time to be my own person.", "First-time mother of a 6-week-old who only contact naps; weighing a swing for supervised daytime breaks.")
add("NewParents-1wvytj6", "pdhj0y1", "new_mother", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "objection", ["price_value", "sleep_props"], "plus I don't want to spend too much money just to have her not like it.", "Still undecided about buying a baby swing.")
add("NewParents-1wvytj6", "pdhuw3v", "new_mother", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "price_signal", ["price_value", "smart_bassinet"], "it looks like the rental is only available in the States, and we cannot afford to buy one.", "Mother in Europe looked at a smart bassinet; rental not offered locally, purchase unaffordable.")
add("NewParents-1wvytj6", "pdi0fbn", "new_mother", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "pain", ["contact_naps"], "My biggest concern is how am I going to eat when I can't hand her to hubby? I can't cook lunch or heat leftovers if she's attached to me, and if I put her down she wakes and cries.", "Husband going back to work; no family support nearby.")
add("Mommit-1wvzsoa", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "question", ["transition_to_cot", "price_value"], "She still wakes up several times a night so will be bedside but not sure if it’s worth investing in the mini crib?", "Nearly 9-month-old outgrowing the bassinet; parent weighs a mini crib against a hand-me-down travel cot.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1ww70o0", None, "parent_unspecified", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "purchase", ["contact_naps", "sleep_props"], "We bought a Najell sleep carrier in absolute desperation to try and reduce the space… and it seems to have worked.", "One-month-old had contact slept on the parents every night.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1ww70o0", None, "parent_unspecified", "newborn_0_8_weeks", "success_story", ["contact_naps"], "It’s the longest stretch of sleep that we’ve had since bringing her home from the hospital.", "Two and a half hours asleep off a parent after the purchase.")
add("sleeptrain-1wwlawg", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "purchase", ["app_tracking", "information_overload"], "i under-researched when it came to purchasing this device. I didn’t know it monitored all it does, and one of the things is his sleep cycle and the stages of sleep he is in while in the sleep cycle.", "Parent bought a sock monitor; its sleep-stage data now contradicts what they believed about the night.")
add("sleeptrain-1wwlawg", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "pain", ["app_tracking", "comparison_other_babies"], "Is my baby even sleep trained if hes having so many wake ups?", "Monitor app reports 9-10 hours with frequent wakes and a lower 'Morning Report' score.")
add("sleeptrain-1wwlawg", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "pain", ["app_tracking", "guilt"], "Just when i think i have this sleep training thing down something comes up to make me feel like im doing everything wrong!", "Device insights tell them to move bedtime earlier.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1wwz4gp", None, "parent_unspecified", "unknown", "belief", ["sleep_consultant", "schedule_rigidity", "free_advice"], "I follow a sleep consultant on Facebook who seems to suggest waking baby up at the same time every morning for a more consistent routine. On paper (on my screen!) this actually makes so much sense", "Free social-media consultant content shapes the parent's routine; asks if it works.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxqb6k", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "ferber", "gentle_method"], "We are not comfortable continuing with controlled crying, although we were beginning to get some longer stretches.", "Day 6 of consultant-guided modified Ferber with a 4.5-month-old; baby repeatedly soiled himself while crying.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxqb6k", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "regret", ["sleep_consultant", "ferber", "gentle_method"], "Our sleep consultant also suggests the fade out method to clients but we went for Ferber thinking it was more straightforward and less days of crying for our baby.", "Parents now ask whether they can step back to a gentler method.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxrrq3", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["sleep_training_values", "guilt", "sleep_consultant"], "For some reason I feel like I need to fully be at my breaking point to earn sleep training 🤷", "Breastfeeding mother of a 7.5-month-old has a local consultant call booked but doubts she is desperate enough.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxrrq3", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["feeding_to_sleep", "transition_to_cot"], "I bf him to sleep (no set bedtime just when he seems tired. Can be between 8 and 9ish) and then hold him for 2 hours minimum.", "Why she wants to sleep train now.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxrrq3", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["cosleeping", "partner_split_nights"], "holding him for 2 hours and sometimes cosleeping means my husband and I never have a moment at night without our son.", "Couple sleep separately on cosleeping nights.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxrrq3", "pdwg7is", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "others_said", ["cosleeping", "conflicting_advice"], "So many people say cosleep and if parents love it I applaud them but I'm really struggling with it", "Responding to commenters before the consultant call.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxy229", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "money_back", "cry_it_out"], "Tried sleep training again after working with a consultant who basically abandoned us after three days because he wasn’t showing signs of progress and crying one hour each night.", "6.5-month-old; parents now attempting training alone.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxy229", "pdy2186", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "personalization"], "Day four she said she didn’t know what else to try and that he probably is not sleep trainable so we cut our contract.", "Consultant hired at 6 months; Ferber plus nap training from day one.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxy229", "pdy2186", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "others_said", ["sleep_consultant", "dream_feed"], "Our sleep consultant on this day (tbh I think she got pissed at me for sleeping on the df) and told me she’s not seeing progress and he’s not able to self soothe", "Mother had slept through a planned dream feed on night three.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxy229", "pdy2186", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["wake_windows", "personalization", "sleep_consultant"], "extending his last ww to 3 h she had us on 2.5 but I think he needs 3h", "After cutting the contract the mother rebuilds the schedule on her own judgement.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxy229", "pdy613j", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "others_said", ["sleep_consultant"], "I had a professional tell me that my baby sucks and can’t be helped 🫠🫠 those two days were rough.", "How the consultant's verdict landed.")
add("sleeptrain-1wxy229", "phy8a0r", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "failure_story", ["cosleeping", "consistency_failure"], "Honestly no, we’re back to co sleeping accepting this as our reality.", "Two weeks later, asked whether anything worked.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy3s76", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["course_purchase", "ferber", "comparison_other_babies"], "We tried Taking Cara Babies and Ferber but he screams and screams and screams and doesn’t stop. Our daughter is 2 1/2 and did really well with Taking Cara Babies and is a fantastic sleeper, so I know sleep training works.", "8-month-old waking at 3am for a month; the course that worked for the older sibling fails here.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy3s76", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["night_wakings", "early_waking"], "I can count on 2 hands how many times he’s slept a 6 hour stretch.", "8-month-old who has never been a good sleeper.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy7b3w", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "desire", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value", "information_overload"], "Anyone have a sleep consultant they recommend under $500?", "Post title; parents want to start training at 5 months.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy7b3w", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "desire", ["sleep_consultant", "information_overload"], "I think my husband and I just need a coach to follow there instructions- we want to start next week when he’ll be 5 months old. I don’t want to push it off anymore I’m just lost and don’t know wtf method is best.", "Asking for a consultant recommendation with a price ceiling.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy7b3w", "peeh4yg", "parent_unspecified", "baby_2_4_months", "pain", ["maternal_exhaustion"], "Lmao ok fine I’m just like fricken stressed and sleep deprived and desperate to get him to sleep lol", "Reply after commenters push back.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy96t0", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "price_signal", ["sleep_consultant", "personalization", "price_value", "feeding_to_sleep"], "I was going to sign up to have her create a personalized sleep plan for me until I found out that the cost was close to $1,000.00. I decided to break the sleep to feed habit myself.", "Mother of two had a virtual consultant appointment during the 4-month regression; balked at the personalized plan price.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy96t0", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["gentle_method", "feeding_to_sleep"], "After a few days, I was able to lay her down, walk away and have her fall asleep completely on her own and sleep for 10-11 hours at night! I was so happy, I thought I cracked the code!", "Self-run gentle method at 5 months, feeding moved 30 minutes before bed; lasted two weeks.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy96t0", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "others_said", ["night_wakings", "partner_disagreement"], "I've been told by my husband and others that I just have to deal with this and be patient, it is normal, and it will work itself out.", "Wakings returned near 6 months as milk supply dropped.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy96t0", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "desire", ["night_wakings", "maternal_exhaustion"], "I am desperate for some solid sleep and routine instead of wondering what time she's going to wake up every night.", "Works part time, also caring for a 4-year-old.")
add("sleeptrain-1wy96t0", "pe0ucrp", "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["course_purchase", "wake_windows", "free_advice"], "When I checked taking cara babies it said 2-2.5 hours of wake time before bedtime for 5-month-olds.", "Uses a course's published age chart rather than a paid plan.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1wzqvuy", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["app_tracking", "schedule_rigidity"], "I’m SO uptight about naps. I log naps and bottles on Huckleberry.", "First-time mum of a 5-month-old who dreads visitors throwing off the nap schedule.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1wzqvuy", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "others_said", ["partner_disagreement", "schedule_rigidity"], "My partner doesn’t really understand and always tells me to ‘just calm down’…. Which doesn’t help.", "Mother anxious about naps and schedules.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1wzqvuy", "peh7tpo", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["app_tracking"], "I only track bottles and naps but I do it religiously. I think I might make a note of her last nap so I have a rough idea when she needs another. (My memory is so bad) but I agree.. I think it’s causing more anxiety", "Considering paper notes instead of the app after commenters' advice.")
add("beyondthebumpUK-1wzqvuy", "peh9fy5", "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["app_tracking", "schedule_rigidity"], "I don’t use sweet spot or ANY suggestions. I just track patterns like yourself.", "Uses the tracker only for logging, not its nap-prediction feature.")
add("NewParents-1x0vxy1", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "tried_failed", ["smart_bassinet", "transition_to_cot", "ferber"], "4.5 month old who won’t sleep in her crib or snoo (started with snoo and she hated it so we transitioned to crib).", "Ferber at night not working; parent close to giving up on sleep training.")
add("NewParents-1x0vxy1", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "pain", ["ferber", "guilt"], "It would be upwards of 30 minutes of crying or more and my heart just breaks.", "During Ferber intervals with the crib in the parents' room.")
